Error [E0989]: this `#Known if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     #Known if x {
    |               ^
 Why: a `#Known if` condition must be a known-time expression — a `#Known` binding, a literal, or a pure function call with known arguments (D-WHEN1)
 Fix: use a `#Known` binding: `#Known flag :: …; #Known if flag { … }`
